Subject: [PATCH 25/25] parts: battery: Fix watt limiter nodes, signed power
 display, and cool_mode

Change-Id: I776e65cec91e16bc3619f5ce88b13203f7a62562
---
 .../battery/BatterySettingsFragment.java      | 26 ++++--
